    "A pace you could still talk at." : {
      "comment" : "Guided cardio: the gentle line under the card during steady cardio — the talk test.",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "A pace you could still talk at."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Un ritmo al que aún podrías hablar."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A pat! I'm counting those, you know." : {
      "comment" : "Companion line when the Good Bean stamp is earned (first pat)",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "¡Una caricia! Las estoy contando, ¿eh?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A photo a friend shared is deleted from your phone with the trash button in the photo viewer, and the whole batch can be discarded at the end of a session. Session messages are never stored — they disappear for everyone when the session ends — and Fernlet won't send a message containing words from its short list of slurs. Recipes and activities you were sent are removed by deleting them where they appear. To stop someone sending you any of it, block or report them." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Una foto que compartió un amigo se elimina de tu teléfono con el botón de eliminar del visor de fotos, y todo el lote se puede descartar al final de una sesión. Los mensajes de la sesión nunca se guardan — desaparecen para todos cuando termina la sesión — y Fernlet no envía mensajes que contengan palabras de su breve lista de insultos. Las recetas y actividades que te enviaron se quitan eliminándolas donde aparecen. Para que alguien deje de enviarte cualquiera de estas cosas, bloquea o reporta a esa persona."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A quick mood check-in." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Un registro rápido del ánimo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A quiet chime that follows your ring/silent switch." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Un sonido discreto que respeta el interruptor de tono/silencio."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A quiet chime when a step's timer runs out. It follows your ring/silent switch." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Un timbre suave cuando termina el temporizador de un paso. Respeta el modo silencioso."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A quiet chime when the timer runs out. It follows your ring/silent switch." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Un timbre suave cuando termina el temporizador. Respeta el modo silencioso."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A quiet minute or three with a slowly swelling circle." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Un minuto tranquilo, o tres, con un círculo que crece despacio."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A quiet minute, whenever" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Un minuto de calma, cuando quieras"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A recipe shared as text is for reading and won't import here. To save one, have it sent with Send in Messages or shared nearby." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Una receta compartida como texto es para leerla y no se importa aquí. Para guardarla, pide que te la envíen con Enviar por Mensajes o que la compartan cerca de ti."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A recovery device is enrolled." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Hay un dispositivo de recuperación configurado."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A sea not reached yet" : {
      "comment" : "VoiceOver: an empty passport space for a sea",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Un mar aún sin visitar"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A second code you can give away" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Un segundo código que puedes entregar"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A set counts in full for the muscles a lift mainly works, and as half a set for the muscles that help. A guided session marked done counts the sets it planned. Warm-ups, stretches, holds and ramp-up sets aren't counted." : {
      "comment" : "Weekly totals screen: how the per-muscle set counts are worked out. 'Marked done' = the guided session's Mark done button, used instead of running it set by set.",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "A set counts in full for the muscles a lift mainly works, and as half a set for the muscles that help. A guided session marked done counts the sets it planned. Warm-ups, stretches, holds and ramp-up sets aren't counted."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Una serie cuenta completa para los músculos que un ejercicio trabaja principalmente, y como media serie para los músculos que ayudan. Una sesión guiada marcada como hecha cuenta las series que tenía planeadas. No se cuentan los calentamientos, los estiramientos, los ejercicios por tiempo ni las series de aproximación."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A shower concert! Encore!" : {
      "comment" : "Companion line when the Encore stamp is earned (first shower)",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "¡Un concierto en la ducha! ¡Otra, otra!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A small daily care companion built around privacy, local control, and enoughness." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Un pequeño compañero de cuidado diario, pensado en torno a la privacidad, el control local y la idea de que lo que haces ya es suficiente."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A small record of being." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Un pequeño registro de lo vivido."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A soft tap when a log lands, and a firmer one for results and timers." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Un toque suave al guardar un registro y uno más firme para resultados y temporizadores."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A stamp arrives the day a silly stat first shows up. They only add up." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Llega un sello el día que aparece por primera vez una estadística absurda. Solo se suman."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A stamp not earned yet" : {
      "comment" : "Stamp book: VoiceOver for a stamp slot whose silly stat hasn't shown up yet (drawn as a faded silhouette over '?')",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Un sello aún sin ganar"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A straight line from your nearest home to the furthest bit of map you've uncovered, worked out on this iPhone." : {
      "comment" : "Silly stat: how the furthest distance from home is counted",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Una línea recta desde tu casa más cercana hasta el trozo de mapa más lejano que has descubierto, calculada en este iPhone."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A tap when a rest or a hold ends." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Un toque cuando termina un descanso o un ejercicio por tiempo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A tap when a rest or a hold ends. Sounds stay quiet, follow your ring/silent switch, and play over your music without pausing it. The screen stays on while a workout runs. If you lock your phone, the end of a rest or a hold comes as a notification when Fernlet's notifications are allowed, and the workout waits on that step until you open Fernlet again." : {
      "comment" : "Workout setup sheet: the note under the workout cue switches. 'ring/silent switch' is the iPhone's Ring/Silent switch or Action button setting; the sounds never pause the person's music. With the phone locked, a rest's or hold's end arrives as a notification and the workout waits on that step.",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "A tap when a rest or a hold ends. Sounds stay quiet, follow your ring/silent switch, and play over your music without pausing it. The screen stays on while a workout runs. If you lock your phone, the end of a rest or a hold comes as a notification when Fernlet's notifications are allowed, and the workout waits on that step until you open Fernlet again."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Un toque cuando termina un descanso o un ejercicio por tiempo. Los sonidos son discretos, respetan el interruptor de tono/silencio y suenan sobre tu música sin pausarla. La pantalla se mantiene encendida durante el entrenamiento. Si bloqueas el celular, el final de un descanso o de un ejercicio por tiempo te llega como notificación si las notificaciones de Fernlet están permitidas, y el entrenamiento espera en ese paso hasta que vuelvas a abrir Fernlet."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A to Z" : {
      "comment" : "Sprout's passport: a continent's countries in alphabetical order",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "De la A a la Z"
