    "Counted on this iPhone only." : {
      "comment" : "Silly stat: pats are counted on this device only",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Solo se cuentan en este iPhone."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Counting every sealed surface…" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Contando cada superficie sellada…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Counts cardio, sports and dance, including workouts from Apple Health. A strength session adds only the planned minutes of a cardio block inside it; yoga, Pilates and other mind-body sessions aren't counted." : {
      "comment" : "Weekly totals screen: which workouts the aerobic minutes include. A 'cardio block' is a cardio part inside a lifting session, such as 'Easy cardio - 20 min'; its minutes count as planned.",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Counts cardio, sports and dance, including workouts from Apple Health. A strength session adds only the planned minutes of a cardio block inside it; yoga, Pilates and other mind-body sessions aren't counted."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Cuenta cardio, deportes y baile, incluidos los entrenamientos de Salud. Una sesión de fuerza solo suma los minutos planeados de un bloque de cardio dentro de ella; no se cuentan el yoga, el Pilates ni otras sesiones de cuerpo y mente."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Counts stored blobs by their format MARKER BYTES only — nothing is decrypted, and nothing is written or saved. One row per cryptographic surface; a surface that cannot be counted shows a dash and says why, never a zero." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Cuenta los blobs guardados solo por sus BYTES MARCADORES de formato — no se descifra nada, y no se escribe ni se guarda nada. Una fila por superficie criptográfica; una superficie que no se puede contar muestra un guion y explica por qué, nunca un cero."
          }
        }
      }
    },
