    "Duress code set" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Código de coacción configurado"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Duress password" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Contraseña de coacción"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "During a session, touch and hold a message someone sent and choose “Report…”. Do the same on a photo someone shared when you choose which photos to keep, or tap the flag in the photo viewer. The person is reported and blocked on your phone, their messages are hidden, and a reported photo is deleted from your phone." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Durante una sesión, mantén presionado un mensaje que alguien envió y elige “Reportar…”. Haz lo mismo con una foto que alguien compartió cuando eliges qué fotos conservar, o toca la bandera en el visor de fotos. La persona queda reportada y bloqueada en tu teléfono, sus mensajes se ocultan y la foto reportada se elimina de tu teléfono."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "During a workout" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Durante un entrenamiento"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "During guided cardio, see your heart rate against a gentle target, from AirPods Pro 3, Powerbeats Pro 2 or a Bluetooth heart-rate strap paired with this iPhone. Turning it on asks Apple Health to let Fernlet read your heart rate. Apple Health keeps the readings, as it does for any workout; Fernlet keeps none. With no reading, the talk test guides you instead. Zone nudges add one light tap when you've drifted out of range for a while." : {
      "comment" : "Workout setup: what the two heart-rate switches do, where the reading comes from and where it goes. Product names stay as Apple writes them. 'The talk test' = judging effort by how easily you can talk.",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "During guided cardio, see your heart rate against a gentle target, from AirPods Pro 3, Powerbeats Pro 2 or a Bluetooth heart-rate strap paired with this iPhone. Turning it on asks Apple Health to let Fernlet read your heart rate. Apple Health keeps the readings, as it does for any workout; Fernlet keeps none. With no reading, the talk test guides you instead. Zone nudges add one light tap when you've drifted out of range for a while."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Durante el cardio guiado, ve tu frecuencia cardiaca frente a un objetivo suave, desde unos AirPods Pro 3, unos Powerbeats Pro 2 o una banda de frecuencia cardiaca Bluetooth enlazada con este iPhone. Al activarlo, Salud te pedirá permiso para que Fernlet lea tu frecuencia cardiaca. Salud guarda las lecturas, como con cualquier entrenamiento; Fernlet no guarda ninguna. Sin lectura, te guía la prueba del habla. Los avisos de zona agregan un toque suave cuando llevas un rato fuera del rango."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each exercise as logged, most recent first." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Cada ejercicio tal como se registró, del más reciente al más antiguo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each serving gives" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Cada porción aporta"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each set gets its own reps and weight." : {
      "comment" : "Log workout sheet: the explainer line under the 'Log set by set' switch.",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Each set gets its own reps and weight."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Cada serie tiene sus propias reps y peso."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each side: %@" : {
      "comment" : "Guided workout, Plates: the plates on each side of the bar, heaviest first, e.g. 'Each side: 45, 10, and 2.5 lb'.",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Each side: %@"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Cada lado: %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each space gets its pin the first time you work out there, so the blue button can start your plan when you arrive. Pins stay on this iPhone and never sync." : {
      "comment" : "Your spaces: what saying yes to remembering workout spaces does",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Cada espacio recibe su marcador la primera vez que entrenas ahí, para que el botón azul pueda empezar tu plan cuando llegues. Los marcadores se quedan en este iPhone y nunca se sincronizan."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ease in and breathe. Stop anywhere that feels like enough." : {
      "comment" : "Guided stretch session (a Mobility day or the rest day's gentle stretch): the gentle line under the card.",
      "localizations" : {
