    },
    "Every bit of care, pressed into a keepsake. These only ever grow — nothing resets or expires." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Cada gesto de cuidado, convertido en un recuerdo. Solo crecen: nada se reinicia ni expira."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every country, continent and ocean you reach gets a stamp. It only adds up, and it stays on this iPhone." : {
      "comment" : "Sprout's passport page 2: what the passport is",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Cada país, continente y océano al que llegas recibe un sello. Solo suma, y se queda en este iPhone."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every place your passport keeps, sealed so only your devices can read it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Cada lugar que guarda tu pasaporte, sellado para que solo tus dispositivos puedan leerlo."
          }
        }
