    "Left empty, Fernlet estimates it from your age with 208 − 0.7 × age (Tanaka): about %lld bpm for you. If you know your own, from a lab test or a hard effort you measured, enter it and your zones use it instead." : {
      "comment" : "Workout setup, under My max heart rate. Keep the formula as written; Tanaka is the researcher's surname. The argument is the estimate for this person in beats per minute.",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Left empty, Fernlet estimates it from your age with 208 − 0.7 × age (Tanaka): about %lld bpm for you. If you know your own, from a lab test or a hard effort you measured, enter it and your zones use it instead."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Si lo dejas vacío, Fernlet la calcula a partir de tu edad con 208 − 0,7 × edad (Tanaka): unos %lld lpm en tu caso. Si conoces la tuya, por una prueba de laboratorio o un esfuerzo intenso que mediste, escríbela y tus zonas la usarán."
          }
        }
      }
