    "Optional. In a long session, later sets can come up short without food — a “no” keeps that from counting as a miss." : {
      "comment" : "Guided workout ready screen: the note under 'Eaten in the last few hours?'.",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Optional. In a long session, later sets can come up short without food — a “no” keeps that from counting as a miss."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Opcional. En una sesión larga, las últimas series pueden quedarse cortas sin comida; un “no” evita que eso cuente como un fallo."
