    "Spoken cues" : {
      "comment" : "Workout setup sheet, Cues during a workout: the switch that turns on spoken cues — the runner says the next exercise, its weight, and when a rest or a hold ends. Off by default.",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Spoken cues"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Indicaciones por voz"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Spoken cues say the next exercise and side, its suggested weight and last time, an interval's pace and round, and when a rest or a hold ends, only while Fernlet is open. They follow your ring/silent switch, in headphones too, and play over your music without pausing it. With VoiceOver on, VoiceOver says them instead." : {
      "comment" : "Workout setup sheet: the note under the Spoken cues switch. Spoken cues are silent when the ring/silent switch is set to silent, with headphones in too; otherwise they play over the person's music without pausing or lowering it. 'ring/silent switch' is the iPhone's Ring/Silent switch or Action button setting.",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Spoken cues say the next exercise and side, its suggested weight and last time, an interval's pace and round, and when a rest or a hold ends, only while Fernlet is open. They follow your ring/silent switch, in headphones too, and play over your music without pausing it. With VoiceOver on, VoiceOver says them instead."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Las indicaciones por voz dicen el siguiente ejercicio y el lado, su peso sugerido y el de la última vez, el ritmo y la ronda de un intervalo, y cuándo termina un descanso o un ejercicio por tiempo, solo mientras Fernlet está abierto. Respetan el interruptor de tono/silencio, también con audífonos, y suenan sobre tu música sin pausarla. Con VoiceOver activado, las dice VoiceOver."
          }
        }
      }
    },
