        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "El mapa"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The month grid has room for four; the week list shows all you turn on." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "La cuadrícula del mes tiene sitio para cuatro; la lista semanal muestra todas las que actives."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The newest places in your passport will be added to Sealed backup the next time you open Private." : {
      "comment" : "Privacy & Data: World passport changes the next Private visit backs up.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Los lugares más nuevos de tu pasaporte se añadirán a la copia sellada la próxima vez que abras Privado."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The next stamp lands here" : {
      "comment" : "Sprout's passport: the dotted spot where the next stamp lands",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "El próximo sello cae aquí"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The other phone is now showing a code of its own. Scan it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "El otro teléfono ahora muestra su propio código. Escanéalo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The part's ingredients and steps are taken out of this recipe." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Los ingredientes y pasos de esta parte se quitarán de la receta."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The passcode lock uses CryptoSwift's scrypt to turn your passcode into a key. Fernlet builds it from a copy that changes one line of its package file (the oldest iOS it builds for) and none of its code. Its license asks every copy of Fernlet to say:" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "El bloqueo con código usa el scrypt de CryptoSwift para convertir tu código en una clave. Fernlet lo compila a partir de una copia que cambia una línea de su archivo de paquete (la versión de iOS más antigua para la que se compila) y nada de su código. Su licencia pide que cada copia de Fernlet diga:"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The passport backup in iCloud is damaged and can't be opened." : {
      "comment" : "Privacy & Data: the World passport Sealed backup will not authenticate.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "La copia del pasaporte en iCloud está dañada y no se puede abrir."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The passport backup in iCloud is older than one this iPhone has already seen, so it wasn't added." : {
      "comment" : "Privacy & Data: the World passport Sealed backup restore refused a set older than one this iPhone has seen.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "La copia del pasaporte en iCloud es más antigua que una que este iPhone ya vio, así que no se añadió."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The passport backup saved from your other iPhone stays in iCloud." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
